        "original_id": "e8e70e71-7dbe-514c-8ad0-f1fd3a85550a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Anders, Micky Dolenz, Nora Balling, Samantha Juste\n- Roles: singer, composer, record producer, actor, musician, television director, radio personality, theater director, fashion model\n- Organizations: the Monkees, Modern Talking\n- Places: Germany, Koblenz\n\nFacts:\n- Micky Dolenz was born as George Michael Dolenz, Jr. on March 8, 1945.\n- Thomas Anders was born as Bernd Weidung on March 1, 1963.\n- Nora Balling was born as Nora-Isabelle Balling on July 31, 1964 in Koblenz, Germany.\n- In 1968, Samantha Juste married Micky Dolenz of the Monkees.\n- Thomas Anders is a German singer, composer, and record producer.\n- Micky Dolenz is an American actor, musician, television director, radio personality, and theater director, and he is best known as a vocalist and drummer of the Monkees.\n- Nora Balling is also known as Nora Anders and is a German fashion model.\n- Nora Balling was the first wife of singer and former Modern Talking member Thomas Anders from 1984 to 1999.",
